**Theorem 11.6 (Explicit mirror-tube exclusion).** On the source tube

$$
\begin{gathered}
267/1000\le r\le277/1000,\qquad |s+r-9/8|\le10^{-5},\\
|b_1-1/8|\le10^{-5},\qquad |b_2-1/8|\le10^{-5},
